{
  "content": [
    {
      "anchor": "a03a8f65-e07c-467a-81d5-808507b066cd",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "cf29c261-e0e8-433f-9710-ae275943d14b",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "85777dba-f9c5-402c-a8e2-8504ee9f7c5e",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "d4e0809f-503f-4c33-8600-625adb5d7f4b",
      "attrs": {
        "headerrow": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "eb868031-9860-4ebf-881e-b410a8b366b8",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "原始策略设想",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_header"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "24b8f3a8-dd62-4194-9c41-2ba6c62f6ffd",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "实验中的变化/退化",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_header"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "08c07769-befa-43dd-a588-fb932dfecdf5",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "退化原因",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_header"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "16c67de8-739c-4b35-a9d0-0393c51db094",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "当前判断",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_header"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "b4cf5adb-a537-47f2-8025-fc2ddb0fd3f6",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "V1.1处理",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_header"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "a5929a7d-814e-40b1-aea2-2fe6422f4781",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Efinish 按城市、时段、供需和等待轮次动态估计",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "22d56bf2-f837-4d5f-a615-522cfa756719",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "R03 开始基本静态化",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "36b70a8f-14ac-4025-82c6-d744fc32079f",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "一方面工程链路不支持多套配置；另一方面为了把等待时长影响集中交给 OCR、增强实验可归因性",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "5988c748-ff36-49af-aa58-014a1589ac92",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "属于实验性回退，不能说明动态 Efinish 无效",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "6fbb254e-bf76-48a6-afc2-ea75d15bc670",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "最高优先级恢复，重新定义并估准“下一轮完单价值”",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "45548099-8ee8-4fb2-abe7-1416312d2c3f",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "OCR 直接预测继续等待后的 ODTP",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "d5d53371-92a6-4813-baa8-34ae4f0e37cc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "先做单调性约束，再用静态 OCR 对照，R04 又增加 0.8 截断",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "1e3d9012-32ac-4e4f-9d87-39180bd2297f",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "原模型没有稳定学出随等待时长变化的合理关系；同时担心长等待时 OCR 过高、过度释放",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "44292934-cade-498f-b7fc-b221a24f7d21",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "单调性有业务合理性，但没有证明净收益；0.8 截断目前没有实验收益",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "5f9d70ff-9c13-48a6-a5ca-feadda2d2c79",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "保留单调约束研究，暂不把硬截断当核心优化方向",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "8dc47ba6-0bda-468e-a82a-f0a005b1c097",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "CAA 只表达取消风险",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "9a8e265a-e98e-4d79-9f43-bda5adbe6897",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "升级为距离加权 CAA；随后又加入近距离置零、减 0.1 等人工规则",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "4ed93980-bd32-4103-b94a-44e01e64f752",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "v4 对距离改善不够；v5 虽然降距离更强，但对近距离候选也过滤过多",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "a8bf363c-2171-4c4a-918a-84949d3e5c14",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "“CAA 要纳入距离价值”方向成立；硬置零只是校准补丁",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "eb9d7303-b2e8-4b81-b1d8-f92b174c1f36",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "保留距离价值，改成连续校准，逐步替代硬阈值",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "3777e919-5f28-46af-81d9-862affb30786",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "β=1，统一比较 TP、GS、HOLD 的价值",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "34b65f14-c869-4af1-8554-441e0414be0f",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "实际反复调为 1.25、1.35、1.32",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "a78d0d33-1b72-4d59-8d48-e93a0db18c84",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "用 β 控制完单与接驾距离之间的风险边界；R02 折损偏大后回调",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "046e7406-0ac3-4638-9ae9-ddf7b2f64873",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "这不是失败，而是证明 β 是有效控制旋钮；但单一全局常数过于粗糙",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "d55e7dcb-2039-43f9-b103-c1715596be3b",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "从全局 β 升级为分场景或风险预算控制",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "8916e377-d04e-49d7-8f55-ec736c6de5cb",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "p_next 描述司机周围下一单机会成本",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "8934a20b-4a22-47eb-9abf-4a925ecdc15b",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "实验中 λ 固定为极小值，同时主要通过 gamma=30/5000 调 TP 开放程度",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "61d4322d-187c-4285-9b28-7574be481078",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "p_next 口径、尺度及实际影响不够稳定，先用阈值控制风险",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "62591b07-5290-4237-b7c1-9359e4350b5d",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "原方案的动态机会成本没有被真正验证，实际作用可能已被弱化",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "eee6147f-9ff1-4195-982f-80eed1b804a0",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "单独做 p_next on/off 和分桶校准实验",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "4b0908aa-b41f-443b-a42e-c204f397d8fb",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "σ 模型区分 TP、GS 的交易价值，原方案认为这是核心增量",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "57cc6981-38c9-4eef-ae8b-b314778fef12",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "R01～R04 没有形成清晰、独立的 σ 增量实验",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "875e1143-b285-46ec-816b-d965b8959c42",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "实验重点转向 β、CAA、OCR 和近距离保护，原有递进实验链被打断",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "fa820b79-d517-42e2-80a6-6e493f8281e6",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "目前不能证明 σ 有效，也不能判断它无效",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "75a7674c-60bb-4297-986b-1adbc5e6c8eb",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "恢复干净的 σ ablation，检查模型排序是否真正改变决策",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "fa7df904-dcc9-4009-822b-75713fe71b0e",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "去掉 TP 硬准入，降低人工参数复杂度",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "8bebee60-3098-485d-b296-97ecf4d6dac1",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "实际又出现 gamma、OCR cap、CAA 近距离置零/减值等规则",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "3f8331bd-e7f0-46b5-aba3-f62963218ccb",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "模型之间存在量纲和校准问题，只能用规则保护线上安全",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "cd622b14-04c4-404c-bd11-4381ed6d2243",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "原方案的“减少配置和硬阈值”目标尚未实现",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "90843739-2423-46a3-8e71-e8363c094a14",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "先统一价值尺度，再决定哪些规则应成为正式 guardrail",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "5b2f0b69-c9e6-473e-9eab-13595ed16c3d",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "构造完整的动态 TP/GS/HOLD 价值决策",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "0d3aefb4-3bb3-4dc7-9d37-9f1603f399d4",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "实际逐渐退化为以 CAA、OCR 和 β 为主的候选过滤策略",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "9f03cfea-1224-4881-bb1d-e91a0033c6d2",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "动态 Efinish、p_next、σ 都没有得到充分验证或完整发挥",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "86ff3be3-c04a-417e-9b38-c7342bdaed9c",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "框架上线了，但核心“动态价值建模”只实现了一部分",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            },
            {
              "content": [
                {
                  "anchor": "0a9d3c81-d30f-460b-b83e-2d9c71c6867e",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "V1.1重点不是继续调阈值，而是补回价值项的真实含义",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "table_cell"
            }
          ],
          "type": "table_row"
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
  "format": "agent-readable-json",
  "operation": "pull",
  "sections": []
}
